# 2. Save this script as `assistant_app.py`.
# 3. Run the script: `python assistant_app.py`.
# 4. Access the chat interface via http://localhost:5000 in your browser.
# 5. Use the `/chat` API endpoint to interact programmatically by sending POST requests.
